# Desktop variant UI

When editing files under `**/components/ui/**/desktop/**`:

- Load `skills/code/web/ui/SKILL.md` and **`references/components-ui-hierarchy.md`**.
- Desktop folder is **layout composition only** — compose from domain `common/`, never duplicate base logic.
- Thin selectors live at domain root, not inside `desktop/`. See `references/responsive-variants.md`.
- Reuse section wrappers; keep variant files declarative.

Hover, wide nav, motion: paired **`desktop-ux.mdc`** (same glob) → `code/web/ux` + `references/desktop/*`.
